# CSSOM-VIEW-1#dom-element-getboundingclientrect

**getBoundingClientRect()** (definition)

**SHA**: hash:6e1af990596627e8ea97e10cba453f8bb1cedfaab61d9d8bdfd19122e31de120

## Content

The **`getBoundingClientRect()`** method, when invoked on an element *element*, must return the result of [getting the bounding box](CSSOM-VIEW-1#element-get-the-bounding-box) for *element*.

